# Neo-Clip — Split MVP Files

## Files

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `index.html` | Page structure, views, modals, CDN imports |
| `styles.css` | Theme, glow, smooth scroll, responsive layout |
| `app.js` | Login, catalog, pricing, wallet, chat, ladder, navigation |
| `README.md` | This file |

## Run locally
1. Put all four files in the same folder.
2. Open `index.html` in a browser — no build step required.

## What's new in this version

### 1. Visible hairstyle variants
- Every card now shows the **modifier** as a colored badge (e.g. "CLASSIC", "PREMIUM") in the top-left corner of the image.
- The modifier name appears in its own color under the photo.
- Each card also has a thin colored bar at the top that changes with the modifier, so a wall of 200 cuts looks varied even where base photos repeat.
- Photo pool expanded to 20 Black-hair / Black-barbering images from Pexels, rotated across all 200 styles.

### 2. Barbers set their own prices
- New **"Set your own prices"** card in the barber dashboard.
- One input per category (10 categories = 10 prices).
- Press **Save prices** — the catalog updates instantly for anyone browsing.
- Modifiers add a small upcharge on top of the category base price (Classic +0, Premium +800, etc.).
- The catalog has a **"Prices for"** dropdown so customers can compare barbers side by side.

